                "text": "The weather in San Francisco is 22°C and windy. Here are some outfit recommendations:\n\n1. **Light Layering**: A thin long-sleeve shirt or a light sweater with a jacket. The wind can make it feel cooler.\n2. **Bottoms**: Comfortable pants or jeans are a good choice.\n3. **Footwear**: Closed-toe shoes or sneakers for comfort.\n4. **Accessories**: Consider a lightweight scarf and maybe sunglasses, especially if you're out during the sunny parts of the day.\n\nEnjoy your time in San Francisco!"
